      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PENNY BLACK NZ (1) drew out and had to work in the Norms Daughter Classic last start so was far from disgraced when beaten 7.4 metres. Overcame a wide draw when she scored at this circuit and distance prior. Should enjoy a lovely run and get every chance. EASTBRO CHRISSY (3) was held up in the Norms Daughter last start but still finished in front of Penny Black. This is the best draw she has had for some time and her record at this circuit and distance is encouraging. FAKENIT (9) was beaten only 1.8m into fourth in the Norms Daughter. Not easy from the outside barrier but she is capable. BEYOND THE SEA (2) is up in grade but has put four placings together, all from tougher barriers. Include.",
